OL,3,GNEWSA'I lost 10 stone to run the New   
OL,4,AYork Marathon'                         
OL,6,FIt was during a trip to New York three 
OL,7,Fyears ago that 33-year-old Elliot Ford 
OL,8,Frealised he had to change his ways.    
OL,10,FAt the time, the dad of two, from      
OL,11,FRotherham, weighed 26 stone (165kg)    
OL,12,Fwith a 46in (117cm) waist.             
OL,14,F"Looking at old photos from that       
OL,15,Fholiday there were a few bad ones," he 
OL,16,Fsays.                                  
OL,18,F"My diet was awful. I used to bring in 
OL,19,Ftrays of doughnuts to the office and I 
OL,20,Fwould mean to share them and end up    
OL,21,Feating five myself."                   
